{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27625","headline":"送人归蜀 · 张祜","name":"送人归蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦城春色泝江源，三峡经过几夜猨。\n红树两厓开霁色，碧岩千仞涨波痕。\n萧萧暮雨荆王梦，漠漠春烟蜀帝魂。\n长怨相如留滞处，富家还忆卓王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}